  "description": "The cookie consent audit engine behind the esatto-cookiescan tool. Crawls a site with a real headless browser, replays it once per consent decision a visitor can make, and reports every cookie and storage entry set outside the consent it needed. Reference it to build your own front end; install Esatto.CookieScan.Cli if you just want to run it. Pairs with the Esatto.Umbraco.Backoffice.CookieScan endpoint to append findings to an Umbraco cookie policy page as a draft.",
